# Proper reordering of paper [6] Example 1.
# The paper's dictionary is [a⫽b, a⫽bc, b⫽c, ab⫽c], which is improper:
# token bc is used before any rule produces it.
# This file uses [a⫽b, b⫽c, a⫽bc, ab⫽c] so the dictionary is proper.
# For w = abcbcab the SentencePiece derivation and final tokenization
# match Example 1, because a⫽bc never applies.
a b
b c
a bc
ab c
